    "sub_name": "畢業論文(二)",
    "sub_ename": "THESIS(2)",
    "describe_ch": "學生選定指導教授進行專題研究，撰寫畢業論文並參與口試發表。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "Students select advisers and then finish the graduation thesis and pass oral examination.Based on developed research topics, students search for adviser to supervise their research works. The final results will be a theirs and need to attend oral examination holded by the department.",
